1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,450
High above the clouds, her
journey reaches its final stop.

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:09,550
A flick of her wand sends fresh
coffee grounds into the filter.

3
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:14,650
The kettle tips, pouring a
silky ribbon of milk.

4
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:22,950
Below, a coffee waterfall
flows into the waiting cup.

5
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:27,550
A tiny blossom opens on its surface.

6
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:33,250
From cherry to bean,
from bean to brew...

7
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,050
A little wonder in every cup.

8
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,250
This is BLOOM.
